    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I mean, you're being really vague. You're saying \"protocols are in place,\" but that doesn't actually answer the question. People are literally seeing videos of stuff looking sketchy with the ballot drop boxes and the chain of custody. Are those just \"theoretical\" concerns, or is there actually a real risk of fraud that's being ignored?",
